OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,7,Fmorning, which may be heavy. Showers
OL,8,Feasing through the afternoon leading
OL,9,Fto largely dry conditions in the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers will clear this
OL,13,Fevening, leaving the rest of the night
OL,14,Fdry with clear spells for most.
OL,15,FHowever, a few further light showers
OL,16,Fmay reach western coasts later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
