OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,6,Frisk of frost. Dry and settled through
OL,7,Fthe day for most with patchy cloud
OL,8,Fdeveloping. The odd light shower
OL,9,Fpossible around northern and western
OL,10,Fcoasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMainly
OL,13,Fdry with sunshine on Sunday, but
OL,14,Fturning cloudier across the western
OL,15,FIsles later. Dry on Monday with
OL,16,Fsunshine, then a cloudier day likely
OL,17,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
